step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a robust mean combination on the full pool to establish a baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse_error to see if weighting improves over the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it beats the weighted inverse_error baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming outliers improves over median/mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the best single model (catboost) to see if a single model outperforms the trimmed mean on this series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if a meta‑model weight improves over inverse_error and other baselines.  

Action: evaluate_strategy  

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a deterministic baseline aggregation (dba) on the full pool to see if it beats the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on a reduced, more stable pool (pool1) using inverse_error weighting to see if a smaller, less correlated set improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on pool2, which includes rf and catboost plus other strong models, to see if a focused weighted pool improves over best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error on pool3 to see if a smaller, more diverse subset improves over pool1/2.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the smaller pool1 to see if trimming improves over the robust mean/median on that subset.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the smaller pool1 to see if reducing variance helps over the full pool mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

